标题:
Fig. 5. Visual comparison between MTR and RDI-Pred across three scenarios: (a) temporary lane change to exit near a ramp, (b) zipper-style 
merging at a ramp entrance, and (c) emergency lane change triggered by the sudden deceleration of the preceding vehicle. Row 1: real scenes; 
Row 2: MTR predictions; Row 3: RDI-Pred predictions. Blue: ego; green: target; yellow: multimodal predictions; red: ground truth.
